Two new files for the "cheapest path" wrapper
start-musix.sh — picks XAMPP's PHP (/opt/lampp/bin/php) for PDO-MySQL parity, checks MariaDB is up (offers to start it), finds a free port from 8675, runs PHP's built-in server, and opens Musix in your default browser. Closing the window or Ctrl+C stops it.
Musix.desktop — an applications-menu entry that runs the launcher in a terminal window.



